ativeTestCompile` produced no dynamic-access input; see `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:rt-fi:4.0.5/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-02T15-42-19-967858Z.log`. The recorded metrics in `stats/com.sun.xml.ws/rt-fi/4.0.5/execution-metrics.json` therefore report failure, zero generated LOC/metadata entries, and no usable coverage.\n\n1. Check out the preserved branch, clean the coordinate’s build outputs, and rerun the coordinate-scoped tests to distinguish stale bytecode from a current-source failure.\n2. Replace the remaining placeholder test with consumer-like Fast Infoset encode/decode coverage, avoiding assertion paths that stringify `Packet`/message objects; do not add build-time-initialization flags or `native-image.properties`.\n3. Once `test` passes from a clean build, regenerate the dynamic-access coverage report and review the resulting metadata before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0424af3fd39329fc016abfd44bda5487d196225467d920e12a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 3632, "output": 1542, "cacheRead": 123264, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 998, "totalTokens": 128438, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790956594127, "responseId": "resp_0424af3fd39329fc016abfd432a67c87d1811813a74d26c5c4", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
